USB 3.0 port and single core 800MHz processor are features on the [http://www.netgear.com/home/products/networking/wifi-routers/R6200.aspx#tab-techspecs R6200v2 hardware] :This device is likely using [[Broadcom]] BCM4352 and BCM43217.
{{WiFiCert|WFA50393|09/30/2013}} :The '''WFA''''s certification indicates this device is using Linux. {{See also|Netgear PCB ID}}
